  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When in hand tracking mode for the Meta Quest systems, it is impossible to open the chat box. I assume this was just because it has been overlooked and wasn’t thought about. Also, within the same scope of chat boxes, it’s also a difficult task to communicate quickly and effectively. Perhaps maybe a way to customise the size of the keyboard? Or menus in general? (slider, 2 buttons + & -, etc) It also seems like the keyboard are unresponsive, having to have to click multiple times on the same key (or the opposite problem, having to do a lot backspacing when you know you only hit the required amount of keys.) I’m unsure if this is a fault of the development or is simply unavoidable.",
